                FF22          save (asks for a name only if untitled)
                FF33          open a file
                FF44          replace: the Search dialog
                FF55          copy the selection to the clipboard
                FF66          move: cut the selection to the clipboard
                FF77          find next
                FF88          delete the selection; with none, ^K^K - from the
